      "The two squarefree coprime quadratic branch polynomials define independent square classes. Their compositum has Galois group C2 x C2 and genus one.",
      "The parent has 17 independent sections, preserved under finite field extension.",
      "Each exact positive definite 18-section Gram proves that its new section has a nonzero, nontorsion anti-invariant part S_i - conjugate(S_i).",
      "Apply sigma_i - 1 to an integer relation among the 17 parent sections and S_1,S_2. This annihilates the parent and the other cover section and isolates the coefficient of the nontorsion anti-invariant part. Both new coefficients must vanish; then all parent coefficients vanish.",
      "The replayed good-reduction orders bound rational auxiliary torsion. The recorded nonzero multiple proves that the parameter base has infinitely many rational points."
